 ba cua con trung g2 3b3d644 tung byte.\nSuite manh 56/56 (3.11/3.12/3.13), ruff F delta rong, A4-d cham rong, S5 269, A10 (v) xanh 3 phien ban.\nWindows that: chua do. Chua review; KHONG day (day = co CI luot 3, can chu kho duyet).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CSM7GNazhN6uGJb4v1TqBT","tree":{"sha":"c435d9a86fa7f389f19c5817b399884bfe5c1fdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ducthangho/tra-luat/git/trees/c435d9a86fa7f389f19c5817b399884bfe5c1fdf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ducthangho/tra-luat/git/commits/5d889bab2ad227d31b1ff800c3158967c65d1ef0","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMX0flOs\nbeLjoAxiJCUILDn+MIeY1+7rrJjvdZbETyjwxXMTo5Xr86t+1ys5990/tmSoMQ5UryT7BcndjUcx\noQU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree c435d9a86fa7f389f19c5817b399884bfe5c1fdf\nparent 3b3d64422adb9a6200071244bfe2a14e42d0dd4a\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791648020 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791648020 +0000\n\nwp698 g2: chan khoi M2b T4/T5 (POSIX-only) tren Windows — tach _ghi698 + chot os.name, kiem mo phong nt trong t52\n\nVa P1 bot Codex PR #721 (discussion_r4238165679; chu kho chon va ngay). Khoi dung ten tep tu D698\ngom ky tu Windows cam => tren windows-latest _ket_thuc_manh nem, ghi698 lech, t52 do. Tach nguyen van\nthanh _ghi698(..., ten_nen=os.name); ten_nen == \"nt\" => [0, [], 0], khong cham HOME/cwd, khong goi bo ghi.\nt52 doi [0, [], 0] khi nt; them kiem mo phong nt (thay tam _ket_thuc_manh, khoi phuc trong finally):\ndot bien go chot => t52 DO bang TinHieuChotCa. Tren Linux KQ ba cua con trung g2 3b3d644 tung byte.\nSuite manh 56/56 (3.11/3.12/3.13), ruff F delta rong, A4-d cham rong, S5 269, A10 (v) xanh 3 phien ban.\nWindows that: chu